#THIS IS FILE IMPWIN, WHAT A PROGRAM FOR WINDOWS HAS THAT THE OTHER SYSTEMS HAVE IN THEIR C LIBRARY: THE NON-LOCAL GO TO OF THE CODE GENERATOR (A GO TO A LABEL OF THE MAIN PROGRAM FROM ANOTHER ROUTINE: A SETJMP AT THE ENTRY AND A _LONGJMP) CALLS THE C LIBRARY'S _SETJMP AND _LONGJMP, AND THE C LIBRARY OF MINGW-W64 (MSVCRT) HAS ONLY LONGJMP.
 THE ARGUMENTS ARE THE POINTER TO THE BUFFER AND THE VALUE, AS A C FUNCTION TAKES THEM AND AS AN IMP ROUTINE IS GIVEN THEM BY REFERENCE: LOC(B) IS THE POINTER.#

SUBR _longjmp(B,V) IS (CCALL longjmp(LOC(B),LOC(V)))
%%
